#: ../../source/docs/rover-control-modes.rst:9
#: e252b7256303407eb31d6c869d3745ab
msgid ""
"Users normally set the vehicle's mode using a :ref:`radio transmitter switch"
" <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>`. The modes can also be "
"changed using a ground station (GCS)."
msgstr ""
"用户通常使用 :ref:`遥控发射机开关 <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>` "
"来设置车辆的模式。也可以通过地面控制站（GCS）更改模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-control-modes.rst:12
#: 5efed658214248cca4a1ad9001382c21
msgid ""
"For a 3 position switch it is normally best to setup one switch position to "
"be :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`, another :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` and the "
"third to :ref:`Steering <steering-mode>` or :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"对于三段开关，通常最佳做法是将一个开关位置设为 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`，另一个设为 :ref:`Manual <manual-"
"mode>`，第三个设为 :ref:`Steering <steering-mode>` 或 :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`。"

